.TH MURMUR 1 "2014-09-23" "murmur 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
murmur \- command line MurmurHash3 utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B murmur
[-hV] [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B murmur
is a command line MurmurHash3 utility.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Show version.
.TP
.B \-\-seed=[seed]
Hash seed (optional).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR murmurhash (3)
.SH AUTHOR
joseph werle <joseph.werle@gmail.com>
